# {{.ProjectName}} ⚡

A high-performance, developer-friendly TypeScript REST API built with [Bun](https://bun.sh) and [Elysia.js](https://elysiajs.com).

## ✨ Features

- 🏎️ **Ultra-Fast Runtime:** Powered by Bun, providing near-instant startup and high throughput.
- 📚 **Interactive Swagger OpenAPI:** Available at `/docs` out of the box via `@elysiajs/swagger`.
- 🛡️ **CORS & Type Safety:** End-to-end type safety and cross-origin security configured.
- 🐳 **Docker & Docker Compose:** Multi-stage production container setup ready to deploy.

## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites
- [Bun](https://bun.sh) installed:
  ```bash
  curl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash
  ```

### Development
```bash
bun install
bun run dev
```

The API will start at: `http://localhost:3000`  
Swagger Documentation: `http://localhost:3000/docs`  
Healthcheck: `http://localhost:3000/health`

### Production Build
```bash
bun run build
bun start
```

### Docker
```bash
docker-compose up --build
```
